Do not send three morning briefs after downtime.

Make the stale threshold configurable.

43. Transcript Processing

Create a Zodiac schedule only if the current Rumor workflow has a real scheduled action worth owning.

Do not invent transcript schedules unsupported by actual Rumor behavior.

Potential action:

