Kernel 23 passes when Pantheon can truthfully demonstrate:

A human obligation is discovered or declared
            ↓
Zodiac stores what is supposed to happen when
            ↓
the obligation becomes due or projects externally
            ↓
the correct calendar/system receives it
            ↓
human corrections remain authoritative
