and:

hourly mail
daily Situation Brief

are no longer architecturally dependent on Hermes cron.

A database table alone is insufficient.

A calendar mock alone is insufficient.

A cron wrapper renamed Zodiac is insufficient.

A GUI calendar where Grant manually enters everything is insufficient.

